  Core time-series storage engine and the repository's confirmed "god package": 22 exported
  top-level types front an unexported table/partition/indexDB layer with acknowledged
  (TODO-commented), unresolved circular coupling back to Storage, a live legacy dual-index
  migration path, and two independently-implemented near-duplicate per-item caches — see
  `god_package` for specifics. Documented as-is rather than idealized, per this forest's scope
  rule. Sourced by direct reading of storage.go, index_db.go, table.go, partition.go, block.go,
  search.go, tag_filters.go, metric_name.go, tsid.go and a repository-wide grep of reverse
  dependents.
